---
/**
 * Temporary tribute to Marc Márquez after announcing his retirement.
 *
 * To remove it: delete this file and the two lines marked
 * "Thank you Marc" in src/pages/index.astro.
 */
---

<section class="tribute relative overflow-hidden bg-red-700 text-white" aria-label="Thank you Marc">
    <span class="tribute-number pointer-events-none select-none absolute font-extrabold leading-none" aria-hidden="true">93</span>
    <div class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-6 md:gap-12 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-9 pt-10 md:py-10">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center md:items-start text-center md:text-left order-2 md:order-1 pb-10 md:pb-0">
            <span class="uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-sm md:text-base text-red-100">Marc Márquez · #93</span>
            <h2 class="uppercase font-extrabold text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-7xl leading-none mt-3">Thank you,<br />Marc</h2>
            <p class="text-lg md:text-xl mt-4 max-w-md text-red-50">
                For every save, every overtake and every comeback. MotoGP won't be the same without you.
            </p>
        </div>
        <img
            src="assets/riders/93.png"
            alt="Marc Márquez"
            width="200"
            height="300"
            class="order-1 md:order-2 w-40 md:w-52 h-auto drop-shadow-2xl"
        />
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .tribute-number {
        font-size: clamp(16rem, 40vw, 32rem);
        right: -0.05em;
        bottom: -0.2em;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }
</style>
